<iscomment>
    Pay with Points injection point, rendered via the app.template.afterFooter
    hook (scripts/hooks/afterFooter.js) - never a template overlay (H47).

    Emits ONLY a static, non-shopper-scoped shell: an empty hidden root div
    carrying three plain route URLs, and a deferred script tag. No site
    preference VALUE, no customer data, nothing conditional is rendered here
    - unlike gameball/widget.isml, whose entire template exists to embed one
    shopper's own data and therefore MUST run through the uncached
    Gameball-Widget remote include, this fragment never varies by request
    and is safe on a cached page (I16 is trivially satisfied: nothing here
    is conditional). The three URLs are plain route addresses, identical for
    every shopper on the site - not a secret, not PII.

    gameballRedeem.js does all of the real work client-side: detecting an
    eligible page (cart/checkout), fetching Gameball-RedeemState, and
    rendering the balance/slider UI into the DOM. Nothing here calls
    Gameball, reads a site preference value, or reads a customer.

    UNVERIFIED (no sandbox in this environment; base SFRA is not vendored in
    this repo): that app_storefront_base's page.isml invokes
    app.template.afterFooter through an encoding-exempt injection point
    (e.g. <isprint encoding="off"/>) rather than plain ${...} interpolation,
    which would HTML-escape this markup and render it as visible text
    instead of a real DOM node. This is the widely-documented convention for
    this specific, merchant-code-only extension point (never a place
    customer data reaches) - confirm with View Source on a sandbox: a real
    <div id="gameball-redeem-root"> element and a real <script> tag, not
    their HTML-entity-escaped text.
</iscomment>
<div id="gameball-redeem-root"
     data-redeem-state-url="${URLUtils.url('Gameball-RedeemState')}"
     data-redeem-url="${URLUtils.url('Cart-Redeem')}"
     data-redeem-remove-url="${URLUtils.url('Cart-RedeemRemove')}"
     hidden></div>
<script defer src="${URLUtils.staticURL('/js/gameballRedeem.js')}"></script>
